{"unit_id":"EIGHTfs__dsh-session-conductor#card-card-zh","repo":"EIGHTfs/dsh-session-conductor","commit":"2302883078bacadbe7b260095db389b72eae60af","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-conductor 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话管理插件。它通过侧边栏管理面板、设置页、会话 API 路由和若干会话工具扩展宿主。用户可以归档与恢复会话、搜索会话内容、撤回消息、修复会话记录，并管理自动重命名和中断后续跑等行为；还提供成员模型与权限切换及模板注入相关能力。适合需要在 DSH 中集中整理会话、查找旧内容或处理异常中断的用户。插件在本机 DSH 数据目录保存配置和索引；未发现额外 API Key 要求。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/apply.js:41-100","lib/client-parts/apply.js:1-20","lib/features/search.js:1-40"]}
{"unit_id":"EIGHTfs__dsh-session-conductor#card-card-en","repo":"EIGHTfs/dsh-session-conductor","commit":"2302883078bacadbe7b260095db389b72eae60af","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-conductor adds a DSH web panel for archiving, restoring, searching, undoing messages, repairing logs, auto-renaming, and resuming interrupted work. It also supports member model and permission controls. Configuration and indexes stay in local DSH data; no extra API key is evident.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/apply.js:41-100","lib/client-parts/apply.js:1-20","lib/features/search.js:1-40"]}
